    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10834" root="خصى" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاصٍ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 1]. They say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ كَخَاصِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَيْرِ</span> [lit. <i>He came like the gelder of the ass</i>],
meaning <i>he came ashamed:</i> (JK, and TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جوج</span>:) and also, <i>disappointed,</i> or <i>unsuccessful.</i> (TA in that art.)


